  "source": "[\\cauchy.riemann.equations:for{f}]\nStates:\nusing: U \\:subset:/ \\complex.numbers\nwhen: f is \\function:on{U}:to{\\complex.numbers}\nthat: f is? \\(holomorphic)::complex.function:on{U}\nDocumented:\n. called: \"Cauchy-Riemann equations for $f?$\"\n. description: \"The Cauchy-Riemann equations express holomorphy in terms of real\n                partial derivatives:\n                $\\partial u/\\partial x = \\partial v/\\partial y$ and\n                $\\partial u/\\partial y = -\\partial v/\\partial x$.\"\nId: \"da109af8-129c-4931-86b0-9dfbc1b146d3\"",
